# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Allow Git to traverse subdirectories so it can scan for unignored files
!*/

# 3. Explicitly allow and track the .gitignore file itself
!./.gitignore

# 4. Explicitly allow and track core project configuration and documentation
!./pom.xml
!./README.md

# 5. Explicitly allow the convenient iris runner scripts (for Windows/Linux/Mac)
!./iris
!./iris.bat

# 6. Explicitly allow the src directory and all of its contents (source files)
!./src/
!./src/**

# 7. Explicitly allow the vscode-extension
!./vscode-extension/irisscript-language-support/irisscript-language-support*.vsix

# 8. Explicitly allow .vscode settings directory
!./.vscode/
!./.vscode/**